codex
The cause is now concrete: this sandbox’s `getpid()` returns the inner namespace PID, while `/proc` is keyed by the outer PID; Lean 4.22 constructs `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`, so it cannot locate its own executable. I’m applying a local, audit-only `LD_PRELOAD` shim that makes `getpid()` report the outer `Pid:` from `/proc/self/status`. It changes no mounted input or theorem and is needed only to make the pinned toolchain runnable.
